Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.59,0:00:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subtitling by DimaTorzok
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the courage\Nthat sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab\NVillager
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there, no regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Lil T\NPollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NDemonRin\NMatteblack
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There once was a man\Nnamed Mont Blanc Nolan.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.07,0:01:56.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx65\fscy65\c&HF1F3F7&\blur1.3\pos(400,825)\fad(1062,0)}North Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.07,0:01:56.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx65\fscy65\c&H121010&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(400,825)\3c&H121010&\fad(1062,0)\t(1020,1062,\1a&H00&)}North Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.07,0:01:56.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx65\fscy65\c&HF1F3F7&\blur1.3\pos(934,825)\fad(1062,0)}The Kingdom of Lvneel
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.07,0:01:56.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx65\fscy65\c&H121010&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(934,825)\3c&H121010&\fad(1062,0)\t(1020,1062,\1a&H00&)}The Kingdom of Lvneel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was from a kingdom\Nin the northern seas.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.07,0:02:04.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(733,730)\t(692,733,\1a&H00&)\t(7490,7532,\1a&HFF&)}Raigo
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.07,0:02:04.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(733,730)}Raigo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:02:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan, or Nolan the Explorer, always told\Nstories about his incredible adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were so incredible that the villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could never tell if they were true or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, Nolan returned from a\Nlong journey to report to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands proud and beautiful in ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city is named Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they call it the City of Gold,\Nwhich describes it perfectly.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&HF8F8F7&\blur1.3\pos(720,800)}Five Years Later
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord5\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&H080C0E&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,800)\3c&H080C0E&}Five Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marie Joie has finally granted us\Npermission to enter the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I would like to send\Nyou on another mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be a slight change, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time my soldiers\Nand I will accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.96,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&HF8F8F7&\blur1.3\pos(720,815)}One Year Before Noland's Arrival
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.96,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord4.8\fsp2\fscx75\fscy75\c&H080C0E&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,815)\3c&H080C0E&}One Year Before Noland's Arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're off to ring the bell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you too, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure have made yourself at\Nhome in these ruins, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, when do you think Noland and\Nthe rest of his crew are coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you ever ask\Nabout when we come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly easy for him to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was born all the way\Nin the far northern seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also has a family back\Nhome, but he promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep ringing\Nthis bell the way we have been,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll show up again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to protect the village!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.03,0:04:02.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,165)\fad(477,0)}{November 16th, 1127\NThe Age of Kaien -OG}{November 16, 1127\Nof the Pelagic Calendar -Polly+Z}November 16, 1127\NThe Pelagic Calendar{T}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.03,0:04:02.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,165)\3c&H252321&\fad(477,0)\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)}{November 16th, 1127\NThe Age of Kaien -OG}{November 16, 1127\Nof the Pelagic Calendar -Polly+Z}November 16, 1127\NThe Pelagic Calendar{T}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does the island suddenly end here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Noland!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe I ever\Ntrusted you, you liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the city of gold you\Npromised I would find here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did the village go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara, if you're alive,\Nplease ring the golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.53,0:04:39.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\fad(975,0)}The Kingdom of Lvneel
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.53,0:04:39.03,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H252321&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,564)\3c&H252321&\fad(975,0)\t(724,975,\1a&H00&)}The Kingdom of Lvneel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan's public execution\Nis about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's this way, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a giant city of gold on\Nthe Grand Line Island of Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of gold does exist, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from one of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this man telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:04:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an absolute lie. No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't trust anything that man says!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were all his stories fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been lying to the whole\Nkingdom and acting like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even a part of our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to see Kal\N'Gorah and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave my men alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For his heinous lies, Montblanc Noland is\Nhereby sentenced to death by beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:05:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant island of earth can you hear\Nthat the singing voice of this beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birth it is truly the birth of holy land
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is definitely where I must live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why can't I breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is everybody all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find yourselves together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tend to the wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby claim this Firth as mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will call me God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandians, we fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot let them take our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made a promise, Nolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We promised we would meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kal 'gara, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you finally return, what will\Nyou think when you see we're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know that we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have so much to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kal 'gara, I have to\Nknow if you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again on the same land one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the great warrior\NKalgara continued to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just once would have been enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he believed that the fire of Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would echo and tell the\Nworld that we are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bell never rang once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then everything was\Nexplained to our villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailors from the Blue Sea told us\Nthat Noland, to whom we owe so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had such pride for our\Ncity that he refused to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deny Shandora's existence\Nand died known as a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great warrior Kal 'gara had died\Nhonorably in battle here in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was never able to convey his message,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that was the Great\NWarrior's biggest regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we'd still be able to\Nreach him if we rang the bell now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we'd still\Nbe able to reach Nolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are close to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll die if we don't run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anaru, what gives you the right\Nto take away everything we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is God's domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is an eyesore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people, the trees, the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let everything rain into the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Island won't last much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, what do we do with the\Npeople who've been injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll treat them once\Nthey're in the boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would have happened if that\Ngirl had approached me any later?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little angels will scurry\Nlike the ants they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to where you belong, Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole in the White White Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no need for God's\Nshrine anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of Shandora is\Nuseless to me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing\Nin this land that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gold Belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I hear two voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he run so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eneru, I'll never let\Nyou have the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that Enel wants up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe he's trying to\Nget to the Golden Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A golden bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, that's what you\Nsaid, isn't it? Piper? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who was talking about a golden bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just before you were struck\Nby that lightning bolt,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were speaking of a golden\Nbell which Enel desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we know what Eneru's going\Nfor, you have to tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we just think about\Nthis for one second, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw that thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're as good as dead if\Nwe don't get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up this beanstalk,\Nsomewhere close to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We promised Nami that we'd\Nwait back on the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to be back with\NLuffy any time now, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coward's right this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ruins of Shandora are in\Nthe lair directly beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The giant beanstalk pierces\Nthe very center of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, these ruins or whatever\Nthey are got blasted in dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we don't get out of here\Nright now, we're gonna be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the ruins,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered a map that\Nrevealed the location
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Grand Belfry that\Nholds the Golden Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It indicated that it could be found\Nin the heart of the ancient city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put it simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the force of the impact\Nwith the vine must have sent
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bell hurling skyward\Nto its present location.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold has a\Nreally big bell in it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm above Giant Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:13:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virgin Sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly never had reason to come up\Nhere, and I doubt anyone else has either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where is it after 400 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be found the golden bell
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear that I\Nunderestimated the little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Wiper, what are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going\Nto climb the beanstalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get away from the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The top of the vine? What's happening\Nup there? Oh no! Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me Luffy and Nami fell with it\NI just don't think I can take it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't go not in\Nthis condition. Look at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself you're a wreck you'd\Nnever make it and even if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you did there's no way\Nto reach inner while he's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flying on that ship the\Nbell it's directly above us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great warrior Aokiji to hear its sound
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little predicament will make it very\Ndifficult indeed for you to reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang around a little bit longer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.37,0:16:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll show you something miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should get out of\Nthis while he's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, my plan totally worked. All right,\Nnow's my chance to get on board that arc?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't rescued you yet I came to rescue\Nyou you dold Sanji and Usopp saved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I was safe down below this whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really you were that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried more importantly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:17:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thunderclouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're changing shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seamus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pitch black!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a giant ball floating in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ball coming through the clouds\Nover there is a massive thunderhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's bursting at the seams with\Nhurricane winds and deadly lightning bolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right above!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thundercloud shaped like a sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has got to be a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What new horrors could he unleash next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everyone will know\Nthat the skies are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the powers of the Arc Maxim\Nand myself, I am unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have become truly omnipotent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.55,0:19:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's falling onto Angel Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna be dead! HURRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EVERYBODY RUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the White Berets escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White Berets saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire island has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our precious homeland is gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the sea clouds were obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a glorious sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is what the sky should look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of explosion was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, that terrible lightning\Nis still falling down like rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think any of us stand a\Nchance of getting out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Island's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you, Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What monstrous cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to take them back\Nsafely to the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy get on so we can get back down there\Neveryone else is headed for the ship and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:22:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be too i can't why not what are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you saying yeah you can\Ni don't have to save
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you anymore but i still have some unfinished\Nbusiness unfinished business what's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left to do here are you trying to get back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at inner room that\Ngolden bell is somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up there in the sky you're after the bell\Nluffy your life is more important than
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gold look at that even if the lightning\Ndoesn't hurt you he can still destroy you a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thousand other ways if it's gold you want\Nyou have a load of it on your arm so give
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.57,0:22:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up the bell luffy for your own sake i
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't die will you quit\Nit already you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know for a fact it exists, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.05,0:23:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it wasn't a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oldtimer's ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I find the city or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to prove\NNoland right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.27,0:23:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in rewriting history.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.47,0:23:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is following\Nwhat I believe is my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.97,0:23:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is between me and Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let Alto and\Nthe others down below know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the City of Gold is up in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.63,0:23:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I ring the bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they should be able to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.49,0:23:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oldtimer and his monkey pals will keep
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,searching the ocean floor\Nuntil the day they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Aru won't take the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.17,0:24:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound from a bell that huge will be\Nheard far and wide by people everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.47,0:24:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm not stopping until I hear\Nthe sounds of the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.13,0:24:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold has a\Nreally big bell in it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan did mention that\Nin his logbook, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.69,0:24:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great bell in the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.45,0:24:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask, Loopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.17,0:24:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why do you ask, Loopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a really good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.01,0:24:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we give that ginormous\Nbell a good ringing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that old-timer and those monkeys\Ndown below would hear it, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.11,0:24:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he says that he's gonna\Ndo something, he does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.75,0:24:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.66,0:24:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.09,0:24:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.85,0:25:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.85,0:25:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard Nami tries, Luffy\Nwon't leave until he rings that bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.21,0:25:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Luffy is after\Nthe same thing as Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As captain of this ship, I do\Nnot give you permission to board.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.03,0:25:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.24,0:25:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I told you that was a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.35,0:25:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.79,0:25:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get to see that pathetic\Nlittle island vanish from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that you're\Nacquainted with how forgiving I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.59,0:26:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially to those who would deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.47,0:26:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, would you still like\Na trip to end this birth?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.39,0:26:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I have finally found the treasured\Nrelic I've been searching for,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.35,0:26:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use another\Ndevastating Rick to annihilate
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.23,0:26:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest of this abominable\Nisland in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.77,0:26:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then every inhabitant of Sky Pier\Nwill suffer my terrible wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.91,0:26:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All will perish, including the\Nvoices directly beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beneath us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will eradicate this unnatural\Nland in the sky once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will change everything back\Nto the way it was intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.83,0:26:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my sacred duty as an Uru Almighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.41,0:26:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.95,0:26:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.87,0:27:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time ends now, Rubber Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.43,0:27:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die with dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.49,0:27:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.26,0:27:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face it, it's beyond anyone's\Npower to stop me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, everything will be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.77,0:27:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, we will send you to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.15,0:27:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.45,0:27:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.87,0:28:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ring that bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never change as\Nyou climb into the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.01,0:28:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you disappear, fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.61,0:28:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.49,0:28:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.11,0:28:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.97,0:29:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are endless nights that come to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.63,0:29:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.53,0:29:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.07,0:29:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.97,0:29:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.77,0:29:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just keep moving on.

